@ The SURF KEY and FLAG_POX_STORY_FUJI (Route 8) come first; the Eevee offer
@ (Pox_Fuji in plastic_ox_story.inc) follows every time until it is accepted.
PoxLavender_HouseFuji::
	lock
	faceplayer
	goto_if_set FLAG_POX_STORY_FUJI, PoxLavender_HouseFujiGift
	msgbox PoxLavender_Text_HouseFuji1, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
	msgbox PoxLavender_Text_HouseFuji2, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
	msgbox PoxLavender_Text_HouseFuji3, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
	checkitem ITEM_SURF_KEY
	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, TRUE, PoxLavender_HouseFujiHasKey
	giveitem ITEM_SURF_KEY
	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, FALSE, PoxLavender_HouseFujiNoRoom
PoxLavender_HouseFujiHasKey::
	setflag FLAG_POX_STORY_FUJI
PoxLavender_HouseFujiGift::
	release
	goto Pox_Fuji
PoxLavender_HouseFujiNoRoom::
	release
	end

PoxLavender_Text_Caretaker::
	.string "We keep the candles low in the\ntower. The POKéMON there don't\plike a bright room.\pSome men in black went up three\ndays ago. MR. FUJI was already\pinside, praying. Neither has\ncome down.$"

PoxLavender_Text_Caretaker_After::
	.string "MR. FUJI is home. I saw him on\nthe steps this morning, slower\pthan usual.\pWe relit the candles on the top\nfloor. It took most of the day.$"

PoxLavender_Text_Neighbour::
	.string "I live next door to MR. FUJI.\nHis POKéMON have been crying at\pthe window every night.\pHe always comes home by supper.\nAlways.$"

PoxLavender_Text_Neighbour_After::
	.string "MR. FUJI is back. I brought him\nsoup and he fell asleep before\pit cooled.\pThe POKéMON stopped crying. That\nis how I knew before anyone told\pme.$"

PoxLavender_Text_Mourner::
	.string "My NIDORINO is buried on the\nfourth floor. Thirty years now.\pI don't cry anymore. I just like\nto tell him what the weather is\pdoing.$"

PoxLavender_Text_Clerk::
	.string "Ferry's not running. Hasn't been\nsince the roads moved.\pCome back when you're famous.\nThey'll find a boat for you\pthen.$"

PoxLavender_Text_Fisherman::
	.string "I used to fish off the end of\nthe harbour road. Now there's a\pbarrier and a man with a\nclipboard.\pThe fish didn't go anywhere. I\nchecked.$"

PoxLavender_Text_Kid::
	.string "My dad says the big boat goes to\nan island full of strong\pTRAINERS.\pHe says only CHAMPIONS get a\nticket. I'm going to be one.$"

PoxLavender_Text_TownSign::
	.string "LAVENDER TOWN\nThe Noble Purple Town$"

PoxLavender_Text_TowerSign::
	.string "POKéMON TOWER\nBecalm the spirits of POKéMON.\pPlease keep voices low.$"

PoxLavender_Text_HouseSign::
	.string "VOLUNTEER POKéMON HOUSE\nMR. FUJI cares for POKéMON that\pno longer have a home.$"

PoxLavender_Text_SoulSign::
	.string "Closed for repairs.\nCandles may be left at the door.$"

PoxLavender_Text_T1Keeper::
	.string "Welcome to the POKéMON TOWER.\nVisiting hours never end, but\pplease don't run on the stairs.\pSome men went up without signing\nthe book. MR. FUJI is up there\ptoo.$"

PoxLavender_Text_T1Keeper_After::
	.string "MR. FUJI signed out this\nmorning. He wrote, Thank you, in\pthe margin. He's never done that\nbefore.$"

PoxLavender_Text_T1Channeler::
	.string "...The spirits are restless\ntoday... They don't like the men\pupstairs...$"

PoxLavender_Text_T1Woman1::
	.string "GROWLITHE was with me since I\nwas a girl. I come every year on\phis birthday.\pHe'd be fifty now. Can you\nimagine.$"

PoxLavender_Text_T1Woman2::
	.string "Have you come to pay your\nrespects? Take your time. Nobody\phere is in a hurry.$"

PoxLavender_Text_T1Man::
	.string "I don't know anyone buried here,\nhonestly. I just started coming\pafter I retired.\pIt's the only quiet room in the\nregion.$"

PoxLavender_Text_T2Channeler::
	.string "...Shh... Do you hear them?...\nSomeone is moving furniture\pupstairs...$"

PoxLavender_Text_T3Channeler1::
	.string "...A candle leaned toward the\nstairs... then it went out...$"

PoxLavender_Text_T3Channeler2::
	.string "...The ghosts were here before\nthe town... They remember where\pthe walls used to be...$"

PoxLavender_Text_T3Channeler3::
	.string "...Paper... so much paper going\nup the stairs... and none coming\pdown...$"

PoxLavender_Text_T4Channeler1::
	.string "...I asked the spirits who the\nmen are... The spirits asked me\pthe same...$"

PoxLavender_Text_T4Channeler2::
	.string "...A radio is playing in the\nempty room... It plays a station\pthat isn't there...$"

PoxLavender_Text_T4Channeler3::
	.string "...Don't step on the cracked\nstone... a CUBONE's mother\psleeps beneath it...$"

PoxLavender_Text_T5Channeler1::
	.string "...Heavy footsteps... boots, not\nslippers... boots don't belong\phere...$"

PoxLavender_Text_T5Channeler2::
	.string "...The old man hums when he\nprays... I haven't heard him\phumming...$"

PoxLavender_Text_T5Channeler3::
	.string "...Wait... wait... I lost count\nof the stairs again...$"

PoxLavender_Text_T5Channeler4::
	.string "...Whatever they are asking him,\nthe ghosts don't want him to\panswer...$"

PoxLavender_Text_T5Purifier::
	.string "This floor is purified. Rest\nhere a while.\pThe POKéMON in your party will\nfeel better.$"

PoxLavender_Text_T6Channeler1::
	.string "...Turn back... no... keep\ngoing... he needs someone...$"

PoxLavender_Text_T6Channeler2::
	.string "...They asked the ghosts how to\nbring a POKéMON back... The\pghosts laughed...$"

PoxLavender_Text_T6Channeler3::
	.string "...The top floor is very cold\nnow... colder than the dead like\pit...$"

PoxLavender_Text_Grunt3Intro::
	.string "You got past both of them? Then\nyou've seen it too, haven't you.\pThe roads that weren't there\nlast year.\pWe just want to know who did it\nbefore somebody else finds out\pfirst.$"

PoxLavender_Text_Grunt3Defeat::
	.string "Go on, then. But whatever's\nmoving the roads, it isn't going\pto stop for you.$"

PoxLavender_Text_TowerFujiWaiting::
	.string "FUJI: Please, be careful. Those\nmen are not cruel. They are\pfrightened, and that is worse.$"

PoxLavender_Text_TowerFujiRescued::
	.string "FUJI: Thank you. They kept me\nhere three days, reading my own\pold notes back to me.\pI am too tired to talk here.\nCome to my house, please. It is\pjust below the hill.$"

PoxLavender_Text_HouseFuji1::
	.string "FUJI: Forgive the state of the\nhouse. Sit, if you can find a\pchair.\pThose men asked how to move a\nPOKéMON without moving it, and\phow to keep a living thing\nexactly as it was.\pI spent a life learning how to\nkeep things. I never learned how\pto put them back.$"

PoxLavender_Text_HouseFuji2::
	.string "Whatever is changing this land,\nit is not my work. I do not know\pwhat it is.\pBut the oldest records of that\nkind of research are on CINNABAR\pISLAND. BLAINE keeps what is\nleft of them.$"

PoxLavender_Text_HouseFuji3::
	.string "SAFFRON is still closed. Take\nROUTE 8 west; the UNDERGROUND\pPATH runs under the city to\nROUTE 7.\pFrom ROUTE 7, follow ROUTE 103\nto the sea. This SURF KEY will\pcarry you the rest of the way.$"

PoxLavender_Text_HouseGirl::
	.string "MR. FUJI went to the tower to\npray and didn't come back. I fed\peveryone breakfast by myself.$"

PoxLavender_Text_HouseGirl_After::
	.string "MR. FUJI is home. He says I did\na good job with breakfast. I\pdid.$"

PoxLavender_Text_HouseBoy::
	.string "PSYDUCK keeps looking at the\ndoor. I told it MR. FUJI will be\pback soon. I hope I didn't lie.$"

PoxLavender_Text_HouseBoy_After::
	.string "PSYDUCK stopped looking at the\ndoor. Now it just looks at MR.\pFUJI.$"

PoxLavender_Text_HouseYoungster::
	.string "I came to help MR. FUJI with the\nPOKéMON, but he's gone. There\pwere men in black on the tower\nstairs.$"

PoxLavender_Text_HouseYoungster_After::
	.string "Some men were asking MR. FUJI\nabout old science. He wouldn't\ptell them. He wouldn't tell me\neither.$"
